com/member/864-jutlander","name":"Jutlander","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"467"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-14T07:02:41-08:00","id":48924,"title":"","content":"My favorite fantasy RPG has a Kickstarter for its new edition. The game is often described as &quot;D&amp;D done right&quot; as the original developers started with all the classic fantasy RPG tropes like dungeons full of monsters and asked &quot;What could have happened to cause there to be dungeons full of monsters?&quot;<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://www.kickstarter.com/projects/783548120/earthdawn-4th-edition\" target=\"_blank\">http://www.kickstarter.com/projects/...wn-4th-edition</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/707-etherial","name":"etherial","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar707_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"822"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-14T11:20:32-08:00","id":49155,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"http://www.kickstarter.com/projects/hamishsteele/pantheon-the-true-story-of-the-egyptian-gods?ref=recently_launched\" target=\"_blank\">Graphic Novel: Pantheon - The True Story of the Egyptian Gods by Hamish Steele.</a><br /> <br /> Anyone interested in a humorous take on the story of Set and Osiris?<br /> Hamish is also planning future graphic novels based around other Mythologies.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Rage CCG Collector and Artist. Visit the <a href=\"http://rageccg.proboards.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Rage CCG Forums</a>.<br /> <img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.us/a/img818/5825/w20supportercliath125.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"ima