son, you'd better be up to the task of carrying all of civilization through the Renaissance and Industrial Revolution, <i>while the Sidereals and Dragon-Blooded are shooting at you</i>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/591-jorlem","name":"Jorlem","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar591_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"287"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-21T12:40:22-08:00","id":54830,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>etherial</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/19047-recommend-kickstarters?p=48924#post48924\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">My favorite fantasy RPG has a Kickstarter for its new edition. The game is often described as &quot;D&amp;D done right&quot; as the original developers started with all the classic fantasy RPG tropes like dungeons full of monsters and asked &quot;What could have happened to cause there to be dungeons full of monsters?&quot;<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://www.kickstarter.com/projects/783548120/earthdawn-4th-edition\" target=\"_blank\">http://www.kickstarter.com/projects/...wn-4th-edition</a></div> </div> </div> </div>I got in on it fast enough that I'm sitting on a Early Bird tier. Right now I'm still going back and forth and trying to decide if this is something I want to back or just back out of, given that there's a degree of impulse; I am vaguely familiar with Earthdawn, but never actually played it or owned a sourcebook for it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/561-mockery","name":"Mockery","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar561_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"876"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-21T13:12:23-08:00","id":54853,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mockery</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/19047-recommend-kickstarters?p=54830#post54830\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I got in on it fast enough that I'm sitting on a Early Bird tier. Right now I'm still going back and forth and trying to decide if this is something I want to back or just back out of, given that there's a degree of impulse; I am vaguely familiar with Earthdawn, but never actually played it or owned a sourcebook for it.</div> </div> </div> </div>Well, if you have any questions, I can answer them. I'm getting hardcover copies for myself and a softcover ED4PG for my wife.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/707-etherial","name":"etherial","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar707_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"822"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-18T10:55:53-08:00","id":74384,"title":"","content":"The manly cookbook.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider