ue":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"49"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-21T15:27:32-08:00","id":76637,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://www.kickstarter.com/projects/davesokolowski/he-who-laughs-last-a-cthulhu-dark-rpg-scenario?ref=live\" target=\"_blank\">He Who Laughs Last - A Cthulhu Dark RPG Scenario</a><br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <i>He Who Laughs Last </i>is a horror mystery RPG scenario set in modern day Los Angeles. It can be run with 3-6 players and takes between 6-8 hours to play. It has been written for (and contains the complete rules for) the rules-light game system Cthulhu Dark, which was written by Graham Walmsley specifically to share with people like you and me. This book has everything you need to run this game, except the requisite friends, d6, and pencil and paper. It also helps if you like weirdness and horror. </div> </div> </div>Hyenas and Cthulhu? Sign me up.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Rage CCG Collector and Artist. Visit the <a href=\"http://rageccg.proboards.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Rage CCG Forums</a>.<br /> <img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.us/a/img818/5825/w20supportercliath125.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/a/img839/9002/ylxu.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1137-laughing-hyena","name":"Laughing Hyena","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1137_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"236"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-27T15:26:40-08:00","id":81270,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"http://www.indiegogo.com/projects/astronomy-legacy-project\" target=\"_blank\">The Astronomy Legacy Project</a><br /> <br /> Not an entertainment one, but if you want to help preserve and grant wider access to old astronomical images...<br /> <br /> (They're raising money for a super-high resolution scanner, to digitize old astronomical photographic plates, some dating back to 1898.)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr />If you want to play Thomas Edison, you'd better be up to the task of carrying all of civilization through the Renaissance and Industrial Revolution, <i>while the Sidereals and Dragon-Blooded are shooting at you</i>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/591-jorlem","name":"Jorlem","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar591_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"287"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-04T09:32:24-07:00","id":105612,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://www.kickstarter.com/projects/1710667762/the-legends-of-the-wulin-board-game\" target=\"_blank\">Eos-Sama is trying to develop a Legends of the Wulin board game.</a><br /> <br /> I know there are some folks around here who are interested in the RPG, so I'd recommend taking a look into it.<br /> <br /> Better be quick, there's only about a week left.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-05T18:02:08-07:00","id":160422,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://www.kickstarter.com/projects/184938819/miniature-ice-age-mammal-adventure-set\" target=\"_blank\">Miniature Ice Age Mammal Adventure Set!</a><br /> <br /> They have stylized versions of Gomphotherium, Doedicurus, Andrewsarchus, Elasmotherium, Dinohyus, Smilodon, Unitatherium, and a mini-mammoth. Others are stretch goals like the Cave hyena, dire wolf, cave lion, etc.<br /> <br /> Great for use on adventures that involve dive-ins of the Pangaea realm or a game set during the Ice Ages.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Rage CCG Collector and Artist. Visit the <a href=\"http://rageccg.proboards.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Rage CCG Forums</a>.<br /> <img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.us/a/img818/5825/w20supportercliath125.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/a/img839/9002/ylxu.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1137-laughing-hyena","name":"Laughing Hyena","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1137_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"236"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-09T13:28:56-07:00","id":163955,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://www.kickstarter.com/projects/sekaiproject/world-end-economica-complete\" target=\"_blank\">World End Economica Complete</a><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#121A0D\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica Neue\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">From the Kickstarter:<br /> Written by Isuna Hasekura, the author of </span></span></span><i>Spice and Wolf</i><span style=\"color:#121A0D\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica Neue\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">, WORLD END ECONOMiCA is a three part visual novel set in the far future on the moon, 16 years after humans have begun to colonize it. A young boy named Haru has been chasing his wildest dream -- to stand where no man has stood before. To do so he needs capital... a ludicrous amount of capital. What better place to get that much money than by using the stock market?<br /> <br /> The first episode was released a while ago and is apparently available on Steam. It's done in the kinetic novel style - the story is linear and there are no choices - and it's done by an amateur group, so there's no voice over and the art is a little dated. However, for $12.99, it still has what I consider excellent production value overall. </span></span></span><br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/75951-ex3-why-gods-need-the-exigence\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Why Gods Need the Exigence</a> - Plot hooks for Exigent characters of various gods.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/113648-ex3-homebrew-solar-charms\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Homebrew Solar Charms</a> - I can see the future, and it is glorious.<br /> <a href=\"https://glasslibrary.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] The Glass Library</a> - My Exalted Third Edition Blog (Updated 24/04/2016)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/54-tiresias","name":"Tiresias","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar54_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2340"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-15T16:21:29-07:00","id":170184,"title":"","content":"<b><a href=\"https://www.kickstarter.com/projects/1911769963/the-lost-skeleton-walks-among-us-larry-blamire-sci?ref=recently_launched\" target=\"_blank\">&quot;The Lost Skeleton Walks Among Us&quot;</a> Kickstarter!</b><br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Sequel to the sequel to the cult comic hit THE LOST SKELETON OF CADAVRA wraps up epic trilogy culminating in a giant monster battle. </div> </div> </div><u>Here's the trailer to the Lost Skeleton of Cadavra:</u><br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Pe9Fs10IIk0\" data-code=\"Pe9Fs10IIk0\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/Pe9Fs10IIk0/hqdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div><br /> <br /> <u>And The Lost Skeleton Returns Again trailer:</u><br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nUsekLY8N2M\" data-code=\"nUsekLY8N2M\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/nUsekLY8N2M/hqdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div><br /> <br /> They had a booth at the Monsterpalooza Convention (Burbank, CA) one year, great people.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Rage CCG Collector and Artist. Visit the <a href=\"http://rageccg.proboards.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Rage CCG Forums</a>.<br /> <img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.us/a/img818/5825/w20supportercliath125.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/a/img839/9002/ylxu.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1137-laughing-hyena","name":"Laughing Hyena","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1137_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"236"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-05T12:13:36-07:00","id":219344,"title":"","content":"Interested in the history of Role-playing Games?<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://www.kickstarter.com/projects/evilhat/designers-and-dragons?ref=discovery\" target=\"_blank\">There's the Designers &amp; Dragons Kickstarter by Fred Hicks / Evil Hat Productions</a>.<br /> <br /> One of the books unlocked is the book on the 90's, which covers White Wolf.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <b>Designers &amp; Dragons: The \u201990s:</b> <b><i>UNLOCKED!</i></b> We've reached $15,000, so we'll be able to print the \u201990s volume at the same time as the \u201970s and \u201980s! <i>Just like the earlier volumes, plus a free Baywatch-themed gaming session with David Hasselhoff. No, not really. We\u2019re kidding about that part, but hopefully we didn\u2019t have to tell you that. But this volume does profile an RPG titan\u2014<b>Wizards of the Coast</b>\u2014not to mention cover the rise of storytelling RPG settings like White Wolf\u2019s <b>World of Darkness</b>.</i><br /> <b>Foreword by: </b>Peter Adkison!<br /> <b>Companies covered include: </b>White Wolf, Atlas Games, Pagan Publishing, AEG, Phage Press, Dream Pod 9, Wizards of the Coast, Metropolis, Hogshead Publishing, Last Unicorn Games, Kenzer &amp; Company, Grey Ghost Games, Imperium Games, Holistic Design, Pinnacle Entertainment Group, Fantasy Flight Games, Guardians of Order, Eden Studios, Margaret Weis Productions, Green Knight Publishing, and Hekaforge. <b>PLUS</b>, Ten Things You Might Not Know About Roleplaying in the \u201990s, and an extensive bilbiography and index. This volume has about 10,000 new words added vs. the previous edition. </div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Rage CCG Collector and Artist. Visit the <a href=\"http://rageccg.proboards.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Rage CCG Forums</a>.<br /> <img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.us/a/img818/5825/w20supportercliath125.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/a/img839/9002/ylxu.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1137-laughing-hyena","name":"Laughing Hyena","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1137_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"236"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-16T20:14:58-07:00","id":284546,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://www.kickstarter.com/projects/659943965/human-resources-an-apocalyptic-rts-game\" target=\"_blank\">HUMAN RESOURCES</a><br /> <br /> Competing Apocalypses. Nightmarish entities. Giant robots. Confused traffic reporters.<br /> <br /> Kickstart the RTS where humans don't <i>gather</i> resources, they <b>are</b> resources.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OeIqZ12Khek\" data-code=\"OeIqZ12Khek\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/OeIqZ12Khek/maxresdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I'm feeling bluuuueeeee~","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/175-prometheus878","name":"Prometheus878","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar175_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1477"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-20T17:00:35-07:00","id":288069,"title":"","content":"It is a sad day my friends. The team for Human Resources have projected that the Kickstarter will not receive enough funding - the project has failed. =(<br /> <br /> Ah, well. Some dreams fall, but others shall soar to the skies.<br /> <br /> Remember true believers, we'll always have tentacle monsters.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I'm feeling bluuuueeeee~","edited":{"userid":175,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/175-prometheus878","user":"Prometheus878","date":". 10-20-2014, 08:37 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/175-prometheus878","name":"Prometheus878","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar175_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1477"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-27T14:32:50-07:00","id":294151,"title":"","content":"MatchStick is a Firefox OS HDMI stick. Not exactly game related, but I like showing gaming stuff(character pic, maps, etc) on TV(through Slate or Netbook right now). I'm liking the idea of this one because of price and open source.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://www.kickstarter.com/projects/matchstick/matchstick-the-streaming-stick-built-on-firefox-os\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.kickstarter.com/projects...-on-firefox-os</a>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Forever and always forward.<br /> Don't ask why that came to mind or that I felt the need to post it.<br /> I see the incorporeally challenged.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/787-sorwen","name":"Sorwen","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"228"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-27T15:10:43-07:00","id":294182,"title":"","content":"I tend to back videogames more than tabletop games. Here's a couple of note:<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://www.kickstarter.com/projects/agustincordes/h-p-lovecrafts-the-case-of-charles-dexter-ward?ref=nav_search\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.kickstarter.com/projects...ref=nav_search</a><br /> A videogame version of Lovecrafts' only novel? I'll take one! Higher reward tiers also include a documentary about the life of Lovecraft and places in Providence that were influential on his work.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://www.kickstarter.com/projects/theblackglove/the-black-glove?ref=nav_search\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.kickstarter.com/projects...ref=nav_search</a><br /> A videogame in which you can change the narrative of the game retroactively? Could be interesting... The developing studio includes a lot of former Bioshock developers, working in the same engine that Bioshock Infinite used.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>On the frontier of the Wild South, there's only one woman with the grit to take on its most dangerous outlaws and bring them <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/984977-back-alive-or-maybe-dead-quest\" target=\"_blank\">Back Alive, or Maybe Dead.</a><br /> <br /> Avatar by <a href=\"http://puzzlinghappenstance.tumblr.com/\" target=\"_blank\">K.S. Brenowitz</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/908-semicasual","name":"semicasual","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar908_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2499"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}